sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Net as SFU / File Source
    participant H264 as H.264 Decoder
    participant Demux as SCC SEI Demuxer
    participant Dec as scc_decoder
    participant rANS as rANS Decoders
    participant Recon as DisparityReconstructor
    participant Interp as PixelInterpolator
    participant Cache as FrameCache
    participant Out as 3D Renderer (WebGPU)

    Net->>H264: H.264 NAL stream
    H264->>H264: decode RGB frame
    H264->>Demux: SEI NAL units (with UUID match)
    Demux->>Dec: SCC payload (per frame)
    Dec->>Dec: parse header (W, H, bit-depth, mode flags)
    Dec->>rANS: decode TOP (8-bit)
    Dec->>rANS: decode B (8-bit)
    Dec->>rANS: decode R (16-bit)
    rANS-->>Dec: TOP, R values + B mask
    Dec->>Recon: merge lists by B mask
    Recon->>Recon: row-prefix sum (inverse S)
    Recon-->>Dec: disparity → depth values (skipped)
    Dec->>Cache: fetch previous depth frame
    Cache-->>Dec: prev depth values
    Dec->>Interp: fill skipped pixels via interlace pattern
    Interp-->>Dec: full depth frame
    Dec->>Cache: store as new previous frame
    H264-->>Out: RGB frame
    Dec-->>Out: depth frame
    Out->>Out: composite to point-cloud / mesh, render
